{"strings": [
  {"text":"YE OTIS GHOSTE","translation":"오티스 가의 유령","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"Ye Onlie True and Originale Spook.","translation":"유일무이한 진짜 원조 유령.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"Beware of Ye Imitationes.","translation":"모조품에 주의하시오.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"All others are Counterfeite.","translation":"다른 것은 모두 가짜임.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"The Tapestry Chamber","translation":"태피스트리 방","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"Autumn, late in the afternoon. The door of the Tapestry Chamber stands ajar.","translation":"가을, 늦은 오후. 태피스트리 방의 문이 빠끔히 열려 있다.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/scene.json caption"}
